          <td><span class="postbody">Audacia Venator is currently accepting applications from the following classes:
<br />

<br />
Last Updated: 10/12/04
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold"><span style="text-decoration: underline">Class Openings:</span></span>*
<br />
Bard: High Need 
<br />
Beastlord: Medium Need 
<br />
Berserker: Low Need 
<br />
Cleric: Low Need 
<br />
Druid: High Need 
<br />
Enchanter: Medium Need 
<br />
Magician: Low Need 
<br />
Monk: Low Need
<br />
Necromancer: Medium Need 
<br />
Paladin: Medium Need 
<br />
Ranger: Medium Need 
<br />
Rogue: Medium Need 
<br />
Shadow Knight: Medium Need 
<br />
Shaman: Medium Need 
<br />
Warrior: Low Need
<br />
Wizard: High Need 
<br />

<br />
* Please note that in some instances, we will make exceptions for individuals seeking membership for closed classes.  In most cases, they will either be a real-life family member or friend of a full member, or be an extraordinary player. Any exceptions must get approval by one or both of the Guild Leaders.
<br />

<br />

<br />
<span style="text-decoration: underline"><span style="font-weight: bold">Application Requirements:</span></span> 
<br />
Minimum level: 65
<br />
Expansions: All
<br />
AA: Run 3
<br />
Items: Shrink Device, Enduring Breath 
<br />
Must have knowledge in playing your class
<br />
Must be able to find your way around in EQ (have maps or be familiar with zones) 
<br />
Must be a team player
<br />
<span style="font-style: italic">Must not be tagged with another guild </span>
<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">MUST be able to play during our raid times</span> (8:30 PM – 12:30 AM PST, longer on weekends) 
<br />
Must be mature and have a good head on your shoulders 
<br />
No loot happy folks (if that's what your after look elsewhere)
<br />
Must maintain a raid attendance percentage of 50%+ 
<br />

<br />
First and foremost AV is a raiding guild, we have a lot of fun and we joke around a lot, but our number one priority is raiding to acheive our common goal. That common goal is progression. We are looking for hard core raiders who can maintain our busy raid schedule. We raid 6 nights a week, Monday - Saturday 8:30pm - 12:30am (PST). 
<br />

<br />
AV is not a "family" guild, we are family in the sense we look out for our own and help each other as often as possible, but if you are simply looking for a chat channel, then AV is not the guild for you. We expect excellence from our members, we kill mobs with less, thus we do not want to bloat our roster with casual players. The players we seek will log on and be ready by raid time and not log until we are finished. We seek people who want to raid and raid A LOT.
<br />

<br />
If you meet/exceed the above requirements and want to be a part of a strong, united guild of people dedicated to it's advancement, then post an application here and look for a Recruiting Officer in game.
<br />

<br />
Thank you for your interest in Audacia Venator!<br />_________________<br /><span style="font-weight: bold">Hunter Revicus Forestwind</span>
<br />
Guild Leader - Audacia Venator
<br />
